  "i18n": {
    "en": {
      "path": "/en/collection/giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface/",
      "title": "Giori Lincoln Memorial uniface | Notofilia",
      "description": "Magna/Giori test note: grass-green Lincoln Memorial, uniface. Rothberg RGMB1/0NSU.",
      "ogTitle": "Giori Lincoln Memorial — uniface",
      "ogDescription": "Magna/Giori uniface trial: grass-green Lincoln Memorial, blank reverse. RGMB1/0NSU.",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Giori test note — Lincoln Memorial, uniface\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/us-department-of-the-treasury/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; U.S. Department of the Treasury</a>\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Press test note &middot; United States &middot; c. 1970s</span>\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Giori press test note</h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Lincoln Memorial &middot; uniface &middot; grass green &middot; RGMB1/0NSU</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"us-giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface\" aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the test note\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/us-giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface-640.webp 640w, /uploads/us-giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface.webp 1537w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 760px\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"/uploads/us-giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface.jpg\" alt=\"Magna/Giori uniface test note: grass-green Lincoln Memorial composite at top; blank reverse below. No serials. Notofilia collection\" width=\"1537\" height=\"1023\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Printed side (top) and blank reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">United States</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Type of Issue</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Press test note, uniface, not legal tender. Distinct from the <a href=\"/en/collection/giori-press-test-note/\">Giori note with cancelled portraits</a> in this collection.</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Subject</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Lincoln Memorial (composite / collage back), grass-green ink</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer / press</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Exonumia literature ties these trials to Giori presses (dealers also say “Magna Press”). Geneva, N.Y. / American Can Company appears in Ontario County Historical Society sources. Attribution of <em>this</em> sheet to that hoard: <span style=\"font-style:italic;\">unconfirmed</span></span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Paper (substrate of this piece: <span style=\"font-style:italic;\">unconfirmed</span>)</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">c. 1970s in auction/dealer cards for the Magna/Giori Lincoln Memorial type. Date read on this sheet: none</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series / Number</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">None visible. The file label is Rothberg RGMB1/0NSU (collector/dealer code; not Friedberg or Pick)</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Direct measurement of this specimen: <span style=\"font-style:italic;\">unconfirmed</span></span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">No Friedberg or Pick number. Type: Giori / Magna test note, Lincoln Memorial, uniface, grass green. Rothberg code transcribed from the file: RGMB1/0NSU</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Print run</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\">unconfirmed</span></span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Known varieties</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The Giori test family includes cancelled-portrait faces and Lincoln Memorial collage backs. This piece: Memorial side only, reverse blank. Nearby Rothberg prefixes (e.g. RGMBW1/0NS) appear on dealer tickets; they are not merged here.</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Circulation dates</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Did not circulate. Not legal tender.</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Basis of rarity</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Press-test material, not a circulating type. Print run and BEP archive for this variety: <span style=\"font-style:italic;\">unconfirmed</span>. NGC/PCGS population of <em>this</em> piece: not applicable (not slabbed).</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">State of the specimen shown</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Unslabbed. One side printed in green; the other blank. Presentation: stacked faces.</span>\n          </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,200px) 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date of last factual review</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">25 August 2026</span>\n          </div>\n          </div>\n          <div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Enlarged note\" data-zoom-dialog=\"us-giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button data-zoom-close aria-label=\"Close\" style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\">&times;</button>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out disabled aria-label=\"Zoom out\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\">\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/us-giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img src=\"/uploads/us-giori-press-test-note-lincoln-memorial-uniface.jpg\" alt=\"Magna/Giori uniface test note: grass-green Lincoln Memorial composite at top; blank reverse below. No serials. Notofilia collection\" width=\"1537\" height=\"1023\" draggable=\"false\" data-zoom-image style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Identification:</strong> United States — Magna/Giori press test note — Lincoln Memorial (composite back) — grass green — uniface — Rothberg RGMB1/0NSU. The code is transcribed from the specimen filename, not from Friedberg.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The type:</strong> in the mid-twentieth century Gualtiero Giori developed multi-colour intaglio presses. The BEP ordered trials; 2012 Ontario County Historical Society notes (reprinted in <cite>The E-Sylum</cite>) place Geneva, N.Y. trials with American Can Company / Edgar L. Pigman. This sheet is not assigned to that hoard.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1,2</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Not to be confused with:</strong> the <a href=\"/en/collection/giori-press-test-note/\">Giori note with cancelled Lincoln, Washington, and Grant portraits</a>, or an issued $5 Federal Reserve Note. More context in the <a href=\"/en/collection/united-states/\">United States catalog</a>.</p>\n          </section>\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Note</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Printed side:</strong> Lincoln Memorial at centre; “THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA” below; “WASHINGTON, D.C.” at right; linear frame; blocks and “ONE” fragments in the corners — a plate collage, not an issued $5 reverse.</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colour:</strong> a single grass-green ink in this photo.</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong> blank (uniface).</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Serials:</strong> none. No Treasury seal or signatures.</span></li></ul>\n          </section>\n          <div style=\"width:100%; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. <a href=\"https://www.coinbooks.org/esylum_v15n53a10.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The E-Sylum — American Can Company and the Giori test notes<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>: reprint of <cite>Chronicles</cite> (Ontario County Historical Society), 23 December 2012.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. <a href=\"https://www.ochs.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ontario County Historical Society<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>: museum cited in that note; no inventory card for <em>this</em> piece was checked here.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">3. <a href=\"https://www.bep.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bureau of Engraving and Printing<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>: the federal printer of record; it does not publish a catalogue of this variety.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "Giori press test note",
      "eyebrow": "Press test note · United States · c. 1970s"
    }
  }
}
